LUNAR — sources and acknowledgments

NASA/space-agency data: LOLA, LROC, SLDEM2015, Blue Marble, JPL DE440/SPICE,
Horizons and DSN documentation. Asset metadata and scientific reports retain
specific source URLs and credits. LUNAR regenerates its browser ephemerides
and native global LOLA map from NASA inputs.

Lunar Navigator — https://github.com/daniel27-space/lunar-navigator
Early prototypes incorporated components; the active rendering and browser
calculation paths were subsequently reimplemented for LUNAR. Prepared polar/site
rasters, map layers, mission catalog records and comparison vectors obtained
through this project remain credited to that source.

Lunar Horizon Wheel — https://github.com/NetRunnerXD/lunar-horizon-wheel
Capability research and matched benchmark comparisons; no application code incorporated.

